# BuildKit reads this for docker/demo/Dockerfile alone (the build context is the
# repo root, as for docker/collector). Only what the image copies goes in, and
# never a local build: node_modules, dist, a venv, the demo's own .cache.
*
!dashboard/pyproject.toml
!dashboard/uv.lock
!dashboard/rc_dashboard/
!dashboard/web/
dashboard/web/node_modules/
dashboard/web/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
